{"id":"294e5ee9e62bf770","group":"27","path":"27/27-thm-lovaszextrema.md","title":"Lovász extension has the same global extrema","display":"thm-lovaszextrema — Lovász extension has the same global extrema","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications","book_abbrev":"27","label":"27-thm-lovaszextrema","aliases":["27-thm-lovaszextrema"],"display":"thm-lovaszextrema — Lovász extension has the same global extrema","depends_on":["[[27-thm-lovaszchainformula]]"],"source_file":"C:\\Users\\lzy\\Documents\\BaiduSyncdisk\\calibre\\Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algorith (5073)\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algo - Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer.pdf","source_section":"§13.4.3","source_statement":"Theorem 13.14","source_printed_pages":"590","source_pdf_pages":"614","verification_status":"proved-in-note"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"27"},{"key":"label","html":"27-thm-lovaszextrema"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>27-thm-lovaszextrema</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-lovaszextrema — Lovász extension has the same global extrema"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"8749982edf417a9c\" href=\"?note=8749982edf417a9c\" title=\"27-thm-lovaszchainformula\">27-thm-lovaszchainformula</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_file","html":"C:\\Users\\lzy\\Documents\\BaiduSyncdisk\\calibre\\Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algorith (5073)\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algo - Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer.pdf"},{"key":"source_section","html":"§13.4.3"},{"key":"source_statement","html":"Theorem 13.14"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"590"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"614"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"proved-in-note"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\\in\\mathrm{PseudoBool}_n\">\\(f\\in\\mathrm{PseudoBool}_n\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f(\\chi_\\varnothing)=0\">\\(f(\\chi_\\varnothing)=0\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{LovExt},U_n\">\\(\\mathrm{LovExt},U_n\\)</span> 与链公式（see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"8749982edf417a9c\" href=\"?note=8749982edf417a9c\" title=\"27-thm-lovaszchainformula\">27-thm-lovaszchainformula</a>）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall p\\in U_n\\quad\\min_{a\\in\\mathbb B^n}f(a)\\leq\\mathrm{LovExt}(f)(p)\\leq\\max_{a\\in\\mathbb B^n}f(a).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall p\\in U_n\\quad\\min_{a\\in\\mathbb B^n}f(a)\\leq\\mathrm{LovExt}(f)(p)\\leq\\max_{a\\in\\mathbb B^n}f(a).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\min_{p\\in U_n}\\mathrm{LovExt}(f)(p)=\\min_{a\\in\\mathbb B^n}f(a),\\qquad\\max_{p\\in U_n}\\mathrm{LovExt}(f)(p)=\\max_{a\\in\\mathbb B^n}f(a).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\min_{p\\in U_n}\\mathrm{LovExt}(f)(p)=\\min_{a\\in\\mathbb B^n}f(a),\\qquad\\max_{p\\in U_n}\\mathrm{LovExt}(f)(p)=\\max_{a\\in\\mathbb B^n}f(a).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>与原书 Theorem 13.14 的极值关系对应；这里给出独立局部证明。排序链公式将每个值写成 f 的顶点值的凸组合，χ∅ 的权重项因 f(χ∅)=0而省略。平均值夹在顶点极值之间，且顶点属于实立方体，故两端等式成立。对 −f 得到最小值版本。此结论无需 f 为 supermodular 或 submodular。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"27-thm-lovaszchainformula","status":"resolved","id":"8749982edf417a9c","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-thm-lovaszchainformula]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-thm-lovaszchainformula","status":"resolved","id":"8749982edf417a9c","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$，$f\\in\\mathrm{PseudoBool}_n$，$f(\\chi_\\varnothing)=0$；$\\mathrm{LovExt},U_n$ 与链公式（see [[27-thm-lovaszchainformula]]）。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"n\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"f\\in\\mathrm{PseudoBool}_n","display":false},{"tex":"f(\\chi_\\varnothing)=0","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{LovExt},U_n","display":false},{"tex":"\\forall p\\in U_n\\quad\\min_{a\\in\\mathbb B^n}f(a)\\leq\\mathrm{LovExt}(f)(p)\\leq\\max_{a\\in\\mathbb B^n}f(a).","display":true},{"tex":"\\min_{p\\in U_n}\\mathrm{LovExt}(f)(p)=\\min_{a\\in\\mathbb B^n}f(a),\\qquad\\max_{p\\in U_n}\\mathrm{LovExt}(f)(p)=\\max_{a\\in\\mathbb B^n}f(a).","display":true}],"bytes":1563,"backlinks":[{"id":"5244dbb38da17b8a","anchor":"ref-453","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[27-thm-lovaszextrema|thm-lovaszextrema — Lovász extension has the same global extrema]]"}],"outgoing":["8749982edf417a9c"]}